 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- Added
+  - Support for `pathlib.PurePath` (and `Path`) values, written as strings.
+- Changed
+  - `None` values are now skipped in tables, inline tables and arrays, instead of raising `TypeError`.
+
 ## 1.2.0
 
 - Added
